<div class="space-y-6">
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center md:justify-start">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20 font-mono-sm text-mono-sm">Beginner Friendly</span>
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-secondary border border-secondary/20 font-mono-sm text-mono-sm">Industry Standard</span>
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-tertiary/10 text-tertiary border border-tertiary/20 font-mono-sm text-mono-sm">Professionally Curated</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display-lg-mobile md:font-display-lg text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg">Graphic Designer <span class="text-primary">Starter Stack</span></h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl">Everything you need to start your graphic design journey. A meticulously curated ecosystem of tools designed to take you from hobbyist to professional.</p>
<div class="pt-4">
<button class="primary-gradient primary-shadow px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-white font-bold text-body-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform active:scale-95" onclick="window.location.href='#core-toolset'">Explore Every Tool</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="relative flex justify-center items-center h-[400px]">
<div class="absolute w-full h-full bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
<div class="relative z-10 glass p-8 rounded-3xl w-full max-w-md border border-white/10 shadow-2xl rotate-3">
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
<div class="aspect-square glass rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary">brush</span></div>
<div class="aspect-square glass rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary">layers</span></div>
